r  if they will attempt the dangerous  rescue and he knows it may be safer for  his son to stay in the cave until the  water recedes once your son finally  comes home what's the first thing you're  going to say to him  I will tell him you are home and you are  safe me and your mother were waiting for  you and we love you now I did ask Titans  father if he blames the 25 year old  soccer coach who apparently went into  the cave with these boys  despite the signs of risk and he says he  does not he says he's a good guy and he  gave all of his food and water to the  boys into the rescuers arrived M&amp;E Ben  Tracy and Thailand thanks he has so many  questions still about those boys could  be down there for a long time we are  rooting for them yes we all are rooting  for those boys
 

